      "confidence": 0.95,
      "file_path": "packages/core/src/safe-git.ts",
      "line_number": 10,
      "line_end": 10,
      "title": "safeGit return type changed while callers still expect a string",
      "description": "safeGit now resolves to a GitResult object instead of a string. The callers currentBranch in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7 and changedFiles in packages/cli/src/status.ts:6 still call trim and split on that value. The CLI fails to compile against the rebuilt core package. Without a type check, changedFiles throws a TypeError and currentBranch returns null for every repository. Update currentBranch and changedFiles to read the stdout field of the result. Make that update in the same change as the new return type.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": "lens:return-shape-contract-break",
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "safeGit now resolves to a GitResult object instead of a string. The callers currentBranch in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7 and changedFiles in packages/cli/src/status.ts:6 still call trim and split on that value.",
      "consequence": "The CLI fails to compile against the rebuilt core package. Without a type check, changedFiles throws a TypeError and currentBranch returns null for every repository.",
      "fix": "Update currentBranch and changedFiles to read the stdout field of the result. Make that update in the same change as the new return type."
    },
    {
      "origin": "agent",
      "severity": "major",
      "category": "bug",
      "confidence": 0.85,
      "file_path": "packages/core/src/safe-git.ts",
      "line_number": 14,
      "line_end": 17,
      "title": "Failed git commands no longer throw, so callers lose error detection",
      "description": "The new catch block turns every git failure into a returned result. currentBranch in packages/cli/src/branch.ts relies on a thrown error to return null outside a repository. Even after the callers read stdout, main.ts never prints the not-a-git-repository error. It reports an empty branch name instead, and changedFiles treats a failed git status as zero changed files. Make currentBranch return null when the result code is nonzero. Make changedFiles throw or report an error when the result code is nonzero.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": null,
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "The new catch block turns every git failure into a returned result. currentBranch in packages/cli/src/branch.ts relies on a thrown error to return null outside a repository.",
